      "id": "claim_81d6bb21c34a4962925d3787ab2312cb",
      "statement": "The integration separates public reads from privileged mutations: the browser client uses public environment variables with CDN-enabled reads, while the server client uses the SANITY_TOKEN and disables the CDN for document creation, patches, and asset uploads; the backward-compatible sanity-client entry point re-exports the tokenless browser client.",
